            "No, because the plaintiff was in a position of complete safety on the shoulder and assumed the risk by stepping out of his vehicle.",
            "Yes, because subsequent vehicular collisions at an uncleared highway accident scene are a foreseeable consequence of the initial collision.",
            "Yes, because commercial trucking companies operating on public highways are strictly liable for all multi-vehicle pileups."
